    "body": "I guess you meant `foo` and not `/foo`? And `/bar/` instead of `/bar`?\r\n\r\nBut this is a case where we change behavior to make cloning work well, ensure cloning is idempotent, and keep overall state to a minimum. However, note that no implementation is fully aligned with the specification either per the tests so I'm hoping it won't end up mattering.",
