    "body": "Oh yes, I need to file implementation bugs still. If you could file one for Chromium that'd be good as I keep hitting an extremely annoying captcha.\r\n\r\nI think I mistyped above, but your example also does not make a lot of sense to me still. If you have both `/foo` and `/bar`, how could you ever expect to end up at `/foo/bar`?",
